WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.459
 

00:00:02.459 --> 00:00:04.466
 

00:00:04.503 --> 00:00:06.579
 

00:00:07.684 --> 00:00:09.760
- Put this on your dash.

00:00:13.408 --> 00:00:15.274
- Put this on your dash.

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:20.522
- Put this on your dash.

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:34.037
- Stop eating eggs next to me.

00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:36.218
- Stop breathing next to me.

00:00:36.963 --> 00:00:38.332
- So, where you working tomorrow?

00:00:38.332 --> 00:00:40.039
- Same place.

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:42.259
- Same place, same job?

00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:44.163
You like working at a parking lot?

00:00:44.163 --> 00:00:45.930
- Yeah. It's fun.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.280
- Oh my god!

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.706
You love it.

00:00:50.706 --> 00:00:52.689
- I love it like you love eggs.

00:00:52.695 --> 00:00:53.531
- Sick.

00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:55.308
- Put this on your dash.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.177
- Hey, Baller.
- [Guy] What's up?

00:01:03.177 --> 00:01:04.227
- [Guy] What are you doing here?

00:01:04.227 --> 00:01:06.471
- Just wanted to see what's
so special about this place.

00:01:07.183 --> 00:01:10.174
- There's nothing
special about this place.

00:01:10.174 --> 00:01:11.703
- Yeah. How many people usually park here?

00:01:11.703 --> 00:01:12.768
- [Guy] I don't know, a couple.

00:01:12.768 --> 00:01:13.915
- So like two?
- [Guy] Sure.

00:01:13.915 --> 00:01:15.595
- [Guy] Can you clear out?
- Yeah.

00:01:15.595 --> 00:01:16.752
- Don't worry. I got this.

00:01:16.752 --> 00:01:18.433
- Put that on your dash.

00:01:28.206 --> 00:01:29.948
- [Driver] Since when is
it 50 bucks to park here?

00:01:29.948 --> 00:01:31.723
- Since now. Yeah.
- [Guy] It's not.

00:01:31.723 --> 00:01:33.282
- Five is fine.

00:01:34.446 --> 00:01:36.220
Put that on your dash.

00:01:36.985 --> 00:01:39.141
- Do you not want this parking
lot to succeed or what?

00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:40.755
- I'm a minimum wage employee here.

00:01:40.755 --> 00:01:42.868
I don't care if this parking lot succeeds.

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:45.002
- Next time, just give the sign a chance.

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:46.599
Can I borrow your stool?
- No.

00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:48.604
- Come on.
- [Guy] Go home.

00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:50.438
- What do people even do in parking lots?

00:01:50.438 --> 00:01:51.204
- They park.

00:01:51.204 --> 00:01:53.189
- Drink malt liquor, smoke weed,

00:01:53.189 --> 00:01:55.535
drink hard liquor.
- [Guy] No. They just park.

00:01:55.535 --> 00:01:57.044
- No.

00:01:57.044 --> 00:01:59.180
There's like 500 square
feet in here, right?

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.673
- The parking lot is
like 10,000 square feet.

00:02:01.673 --> 00:02:03.772
Wait. Why does that matter?

00:02:29.381 --> 00:02:31.238
- Yes. That will be 50 dollars, Miss.

00:02:31.238 --> 00:02:32.423
- Very funny.

00:02:32.423 --> 00:02:34.582
But while you've been
wasting away on that stool,

00:02:34.582 --> 00:02:36.530
I figured out how to save the parking lot.

00:02:38.889 --> 00:02:40.039
- [Guy] Bananas.

00:02:40.039 --> 00:02:41.870
- No! A Farmer's Market.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:43.599
- One table with some shitty fruit

00:02:43.599 --> 00:02:45.805
does not make a Farmer's Market.

00:02:45.805 --> 00:02:47.721
- Well, I've been tweeting
about it for the last hour.

00:02:47.721 --> 00:02:49.856
So the other farmers should arrive soon.

00:02:49.856 --> 00:02:51.111
- Do farmers even Twitter?

00:02:51.111 --> 00:02:52.690
- I've also been Snap
Chatting like a beast.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.126
So, trust me. The word's
getting out there.

00:02:56.683 --> 00:02:58.193
Can I borrow your stool?

00:02:58.193 --> 00:02:59.770
- No.

00:03:00.538 --> 00:03:02.737
- [Farmer] Just set up anywhere?

00:03:02.737 --> 00:03:04.164
- This is too much.

00:03:04.164 --> 00:03:06.414
- Vendor's fee is 50 bucks, right?

00:03:06.414 --> 00:03:07.378
- Oh, yeah.

00:03:08.039 --> 00:03:10.530
Why don't you set up next to that girl?

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:12.144
- You got it chief.

00:03:13.242 --> 00:03:15.445
- [Girl] Man, that drought must've--

00:03:15.445 --> 00:03:17.032
- I don't want to talk about it.

00:03:17.032 --> 00:03:18.670
- Hey, you have to shut this down.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.738
- Shut it down, why?

00:03:19.738 --> 00:03:20.841
This is awesome,

00:03:20.841 --> 00:03:23.255
and I bartered three unripe
bananas for these babies.

00:03:23.255 --> 00:03:24.428
- There are too many people here.

00:03:24.428 --> 00:03:25.597
They keep asking me questions.

00:03:25.597 --> 00:03:27.071
- You don't have to
answer their questions.

00:03:27.071 --> 00:03:28.650
You're just the parking lot attendant.

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.206
- At a lot where nobody can park.

00:03:30.206 --> 00:03:31.976
Look, they're taking up all the spaces.

00:03:33.651 --> 00:03:35.599
- Just go back to your stool.

00:03:36.344 --> 00:03:38.270
You look great in that polo.

00:03:39.502 --> 00:03:41.356
- Did you see a goat pass through here?

00:03:41.356 --> 00:03:43.458
- I'm picking up a very dark auroa.

00:03:43.458 --> 00:03:44.781
Would you like me to cleanse you?

00:03:44.781 --> 00:03:47.368
- Hey, can you review my
necklace for my Etsy account?

00:03:47.964 --> 00:03:50.077
- You could actually just have it back.

00:03:50.661 --> 00:03:53.351
If I reviewed it, I
would say it's terrible.

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.515
- Hey, Dude. I really got to pee.

00:03:54.515 --> 00:03:56.824
Is there a designated area for that here?

00:03:58.069 --> 00:03:59.114
All right. Well my take away from this is

00:03:59.114 --> 00:04:00.993
that I could just pee anywhere then.

00:04:01.773 --> 00:04:02.876
- Hey, no peeing in the lot!

00:04:02.876 --> 00:04:04.987
- [Man] I've already started. I'm sorry.

00:04:06.139 --> 00:04:08.018
Oh, it's so much pee!

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:12.293
- Hey! If I don't sell
those, I lose the farm.

00:04:12.293 --> 00:04:13.292
- There's no farm.

00:04:13.292 --> 00:04:14.151
- There's a farm somewhere.

00:04:14.151 --> 00:04:15.126
Just 'cause you can't see it,

00:04:15.126 --> 00:04:16.798
doesn't mean it doesn't exist.

00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:17.507
- Britney, I'm serious.

00:04:17.507 --> 00:04:19.678
I don't want to work any Farmer's Market.

00:04:19.678 --> 00:04:22.187
I want to work in a parking
lot where nobody parks.

00:04:22.187 --> 00:04:23.088
- Why would you want that

00:04:23.088 --> 00:04:24.235
when you could have all this?

00:04:24.235 --> 00:04:26.618
There's juice samples and crystals.

00:04:26.618 --> 00:04:28.059
- I don't like juice samples and crystals.

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:29.487
- Okay, we can get different vendors.

00:04:29.487 --> 00:04:30.568
- I don't want any vendors.

00:04:30.568 --> 00:04:32.297
I want this place back the way it was.

00:04:32.297 --> 00:04:33.840
- Okay. I was just trying to help.

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:36.150
- Help me by getting
this crap out of here.

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.729
- Am I the crap?

00:04:37.729 --> 00:04:39.991
Am I included in the crap?

00:04:40.075 --> 00:04:41.805
- No. You're not the crap.

00:04:41.805 --> 00:04:44.683
This morning I had a
job that I liked and--

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:46.395
- And now you don't.

00:04:46.395 --> 00:04:48.230
No, it's okay. I get it.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:49.726
- Britney.

00:04:49.809 --> 00:04:51.689
- I had to take matters into my own hands.

00:04:51.689 --> 00:04:54.590
Your negative energy is
poisoning all of us now.

00:04:54.847 --> 00:04:56.900
- Can I get some of that?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.693
You know, watching you tear

00:04:57.693 --> 00:05:00.896
into your sister like
that, hurt my feelings.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.609
Hey.

00:05:07.463 --> 00:05:09.243
I'm sorry.

00:05:13.063 --> 00:05:14.978
- I don't care

00:05:30.826 --> 00:05:32.195
- [Guy] Hey.

00:05:34.543 --> 00:05:36.502
Hey, I have something to show you.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.472
Remember your twelfth birthday party,

00:05:41.472 --> 00:05:43.399
I threw up in the pool

00:05:43.399 --> 00:05:45.872
from eating too much ice cream cake?

00:05:47.742 --> 00:05:49.669
I actually threw up because

00:05:49.669 --> 00:05:51.224
I was really nervous to be around

00:05:51.224 --> 00:05:53.289
all of your older friends.

00:05:54.974 --> 00:05:56.320
I mean.

00:05:56.658 --> 00:05:57.460
I don't see why you can't swim

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:59.388
in a pool full of throw-up anyway.

00:05:59.388 --> 00:06:02.039
It's just, chlorine water's gross.

00:06:02.039 --> 00:06:04.035
- There were chunks in the filter.

00:06:04.035 --> 00:06:06.170
- You're not swimming in the filter.

00:06:08.053 --> 00:06:10.396
You think today was worse than that?

00:06:12.185 --> 00:06:14.646
- I don't know. I mean
you ruined my reputation.

00:06:15.064 --> 00:06:17.119
- Like, among the farmers?

00:06:17.119 --> 00:06:18.338
- No.

00:06:18.338 --> 00:06:20.080
Among the twelve-year-olds.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.132
Especially, Crystal.

00:06:22.425 --> 00:06:23.513
She was really hot.

00:06:23.513 --> 00:06:25.451
- I had a crush on Crystal!

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:26.935
- Me too.

00:06:29.747 --> 00:06:32.035
- Come on. Let me show you something.

00:06:32.035 --> 00:06:34.530
- I'll even let you sit on my stool.

00:06:36.388 --> 00:06:37.688
- Okay.

00:06:52.328 --> 00:06:54.463
- Yeah, I'll take three.

00:06:56.078 --> 00:06:57.504
- [Britney] Wow!

00:06:57.682 --> 00:06:59.596
You did all this for me?

00:06:59.597 --> 00:07:00.982
- I kind of did it for me.

00:07:00.982 --> 00:07:02.781
- Holy shit! I'm awesome!

00:07:02.781 --> 00:07:04.974
- You're okay.

00:07:05.184 --> 00:07:08.342
- So you're not still mad
at me for doing your thing?

00:07:08.342 --> 00:07:10.815
- It's cool. I get a new thing.

00:07:10.815 --> 00:07:12.847
Subscribe for more wonder things.

00:07:12.847 --> 00:07:15.109
Faking It At Work.

